{"id": "t084-001", "text": "Ebony has a second interview at the architecture firm next Tuesday. She sounded really nervous about the presentation part. She's spent the whole weekend rebuilding her portfolio and says she still isn't happy with it. Her partner is taking her out for breakfast beforehand to calm her down. Remind me to text her good luck on Monday night.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ebony", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "second interview at the architecture firm", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the whole weekend"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "isn't happy with it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "breakfast", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "beforehand", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday night", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t084-004", "text": "Called Agnieszka. She didn't get the job at the council, but they said she was a close second and to apply again in early March.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Agnieszka", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job at the council", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "apply again", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in early March", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t084-012", "text": "Ibrahim said the five-a-side final got called off because half the other team have flu. They might replay it end of the month.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ibrahim", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "five-a-side", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "replay it", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t084-013", "text": "Javier mentioned his sister Mabel is applying for nursing jobs in Leeds. She has an assessment day next Wednesday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Javier", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mabel", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "nursing jobs in Leeds", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "assessment day", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Wednesday", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t084-020", "text": "Mia has applied for a head of department role at her school. Interviews are sometime next week, but she hasn't heard which day yet. She's up against a colleague she gets on well with, which makes it awkward in the staffroom. She's asked me to do a mock interview with her on Sunday afternoon, so I should dig out some typical questions.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "head of department role at her school", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Interviews", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "colleague", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "awkward", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "mock interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday afternoon", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "dig out some typical questions", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t084-025", "text": "Niamh said she's thinking of applying for the PhD in Galway. Deadline is the end of January.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Niamh", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "PhD in Galway", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of January", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t084-029", "text": "Shira and her wife are moving to Bristol at the end of the month. Their new place has a garden for the cats, Pickle and Fig.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shira", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Bristol", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "has a garden", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "cats, Pickle and Fig", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}]}
{"id": "t084-033", "text": "Spoke to Anders Olsen at the conference. He runs recruitment for a fintech in Oslo and said to send him my CV sometime next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anders Olsen", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "runs recruitment for a fintech in Oslo", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him my CV", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t084-034", "text": "Jada's interview at the BBC went well. They said she'd hear back by Friday. Remind me to text her on Saturday if she hasn't said anything. If she gets it, she'd be moving to Salford sometime in the new year, which she's quite excited about. Her flatmate Esme is already looking at rooms up there too.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jada", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview at the BBC", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hear back", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Friday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "message", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Salford", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in the new year", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "quite excited", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "flatmate", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esme", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t084-036", "text": "Moira is a huge rugby fan and never misses a Scotland match. She has a season ticket at Murrayfield.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Moira", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "rugby", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Scotland", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "season ticket at Murrayfield", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t084-048", "text": "Isabel Reyes from the interview panel said they'd make a decision by the end of the week. She also mentioned they're hiring a second analyst over the summer.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Isabel Reyes", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "interview panel", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "decision", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by the end of the week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer"}]}
{"id": "t084-051", "text": "Jess has had a rough week. She was made redundant on Monday and has a meeting with HR on Friday about the package. Remind me to call her on Friday evening to see how she's doing. She also mentioned she might retrain as a teacher, which she's wanted to do for years.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jess", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "meeting with HR", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday evening", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "might retrain as a teacher", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "years"}]}
{"id": "t084-052", "text": "Mrs Thomas next door is entering her marrows in the village show this weekend. She won second place last year and has been out in the garden at dawn every day.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mrs Thomas", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "next door", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "marrows", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "village show", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "last year"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "dawn every day"}]}
{"id": "t084-053", "text": "Remember the MOT on Tuesday, drop the car off by eight. Pick up a prescription on the way back.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "MOT", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop the car off", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by eight", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Pick up a prescription", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the way back", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t084-054", "text": "Uncle Gustavo is doing a charity swim across Lake Windermere next month. He's seventy-one and has been training at the lido every morning. The family are all going to Bowness to cheer him on, and Aunt Moira is organising a picnic for afterwards. Should sponsor him before the deadline.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uncle Gustavo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "charity swim across Lake Windermere", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "seventy-one", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every morning"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aunt Moira", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "picnic", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sponsor him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "before the deadline", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t084-058", "text": "Thinking about applying for the project manager role that came up internally. Applications close sometime next week, so I need to update my CV over the weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "project manager role", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "update my CV", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the weekend", "anchor": "a1"}]}
